    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if i agree with that. i've heard people say that AI can actually free up employees to do more creative/higher-level work instead of just replacing them. isn't it possible that the \"optimization\" could lead to better roles for everyone rather than just a zero-sum game where people lose their jobs?",
